## Reviewer got wrong — not applied
- Deleting the U+200B breaks, or promoting Q16–Q20 to headings (a#11, b#13, and the “one clause per paragraph” merge in b#25). Those breaks match the Korean source. Removing them fails `blocks` / `headings`. The lines are choppy because the source is choppy.
- Rewriting comma amounts as 万 (b#36), including 157万9589. Mainland grouping is right for a reader; this checker does not parse simplified 万, and a remainder after 万 (9589) is a second number. Commas kept.
- The llms.txt suggestion “也不保证一定会被展示”. The refusal is right; the word 保证 is forbidden by the zh-hans pack test. Wording used is 不承诺.
- Nothing else in the P1/P2 rows looked legally wrong. The 004 link really is the withholding-rate standard article 3, not 营业税法第10条; 第10条 stays in the label only so the digit 10 still parses.
